g_{2n+1} &= g_{2n-1}^2+g_{2n-2}^2 \\
g_{2n} &= 2g_{2n-1}g_{2n-2}-g_{2n-2}^2
\end{align*}
Compute the remainder when $g_{2011}$ is divided by $216$.

