problem:
An $8$-cm-by-$8$-cm square is partitioned as shown. Points $A$ and $B$ are the midpoints of two opposite sides of the square. What is the area of the shaded region?

[asy]
draw((0,0)--(10,0));
draw((10,0)--(10,10));
draw((10,10)--(0,10));
draw((0,0)--(0,10));
draw((0,0)--(5,10));
draw((5,10)--(10,0));
draw((0,10)--(5,0));
draw((5,0)--(10,10));
fill((5,0)--(7.5,5)--(5,10)--(2.5,5)--cycle,gray);
label("A",(5,10),N);
label("B",(5,0),S);
[/asy]

